<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container my-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-9 mx-auto">

            <h2 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p class="text-muted">Last Updated: November 2026</p>

            <p>
                At WanderLust, we respect your privacy and are committed
                to protecting the personal information you share with us.
                This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected,
                used and protected when you use our platform.
            </p>

            <hr>

            <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
            <p>We may collect the following information:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Username and account information.</li>
                <li>Listing details, descriptions and uploaded images.</li>
                <li>Reviews and other content submitted by users.</li>
                <li>Basic technical information required to operate the website.</li>
            </ul>

            <h4>2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
            <p>Information may be used to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Create and manage user accounts.</li>
                <li>Display property listings and reviews.</li>
                <li>Improve website functionality and user experience.</li>
                <li>Maintain website security and prevent misuse.</li>
            </ul>

            <h4>3. Cookies and Sessions</h4>
            <p>
                WanderLust uses sessions and cookies to maintain user
                authentication and provide essential website functionality.
            </p>

            <h4>4. Third-Party Services</h4>
            <p>
                Our platform may use third-party services such as MongoDB,
                Cloudinary and Mapbox to support database storage, image
                uploads and location-based features. These services may
                process information according to their own privacy policies.
            </p>

            <h4>5. Data Security</h4>
            <p>
                We take reasonable measures to protect user information.
                However, no online platform can guarantee complete security
                of information transmitted over the internet.
            </p>

            <h4>6. Information Sharing</h4>
            <p>
                We do not intend to sell users' personal information.
                Information may be shared with service providers when
                necessary to operate the platform or when required by law.
            </p>

            <h4>7. User Responsibilities</h4>
            <p>
                Users should keep their login credentials confidential
                and avoid sharing sensitive personal information through
                public listings or reviews.
            </p>

            <h4>8. Policy Updates</h4>
            <p>
                This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time.
                Changes will be reflected on this page.
            </p>

            <h4>9. Contact</h4>
            <p>
                For questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please
                contact the WanderLust development team.
            </p>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>